.TH QUIPU-GRAPH-OVERLAY-COMPOSE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-graph\-overlay\-compose \- Resolve an overlay\*(Aqs composed view over its parent
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu graph overlay\-compose\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-input\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Resolve an overlay\*(Aqs composed view over its parent
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-input\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Input file for this operation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
